  The caption adds 'இதே நாளில், மெரினா லூப் சாலையில் 79 ஆக்கிரமிப்புக் கடைகள் அகற்றப்பட்டன' ('on the same day, 79 encroaching shops were removed on Marina Loop Road'), a second unrelated fact mixed into the caption that the article only lists as a separate headline; it is not part of the arrest story and the article does not say it occurred on the same day.
  The reel_script's description of the accused as '26 வயது' and the caption's 'வயது' wording are supported, but the slides_spec 'hl2' gives 'நீதிமன்றக் காவல் டிச.10 வரை' which is accurate; no other problems found.
